msgstr ""
"Eneo limegawanywa katika kazi za ~ 10 majengo kila moja, kwa kutumia "
"barabara, mito,\n"
"              reli na viwanja vya ndege kama mipaka."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:51
msgid "Photo upload is enabled but optional."
msgstr "Upakiaji wa picha umewashwa lakini ni wa hiari."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:52
msgid "A basemap is generated automatically for offline use (if available)."
msgstr ""
"Ramani ya msingi inatolewa kiotomatiki kwa matumizi ya nje ya mtandao "
"(ikiwa inapatikana)."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:55
msgid "Preview the building survey in XLSForm Editor →"
msgstr "Hakiki uchunguzi wa jengo katika Kihariri cha Fomu ya XLS →"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:71
msgid "Something else"
msgstr "Kitu kingine"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:74
msgid ""
"For anything that isn't tagging OSM buildings - bring your own survey, or"
" use one\n"
"          contributed by the community."
msgstr ""
"Kwa chochote ambacho hakijatambulisha majengo ya OSM - leta uchunguzi "
"wako mwenyewe, au tumia moja\n"
"          imechangiwa na jamii."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:80
msgid ""
"Other OpenStreetMap features - roads, water points, schools, healthcare, "
"and\n"
"            more"
msgstr ""
"Vipengele vingine vya OpenStreetMap - barabara, vituo vya maji, shule, "
"huduma za afya, na\n"
"            zaidi"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:84
msgid ""
"Non-OSM surveys - vaccination campaigns, census mapping, healthcare "
"facility\n"
"            audits, infrastructure inspections"
msgstr ""
"Tafiti zisizo za OSM - kampeni za chanjo, ramani ya sensa, kituo cha "
"huduma ya afya\n"
"            ukaguzi, ukaguzi wa miundombinu"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:87
msgid "Bring your own map data, or start with an empty map"
msgstr "Leta data yako mwenyewe ya ramani, au anza na ramani tupu"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:88
msgid "Control how the area is divided up for mappers"
msgstr "Dhibiti jinsi eneo linavyogawanywa kwa wachoraji ramani"

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:91
msgid "Set up a custom project"
msgstr "Tafuta miradi…"

