msgstr "Chunguza miradi"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:9
msgid ""
"Just the basics on this page: what you're mapping, where, and which app "
"mappers will use.\n"
"    You'll pick your survey questions and map data on the next page."
msgstr ""
"Mambo ya msingi tu kwenye ukurasa huu: unachochora, wapi, na programu "
"ambayo wachoraji ramani watatumia. Utachagua maswali ya dodoso na data ya"
" ramani kwenye ukurasa unaofuata."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:32
msgid "About your project"
msgstr "Rudi kwenye miradi"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:34
msgid ""
"Give your project a clear name and a short summary so mappers know what "
"it's\n"
"          about."
msgstr ""
"Ipe mradi wako jina wazi na muhtasari mfupi ili wachoraji ramani wajue "
"unahusu nini."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:40
msgid "Project name"
msgstr "Jina la mradi"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:45
msgid "e.g. Buildings in West Nairobi"
msgstr "mf. Majengo Magharibi mwa Nairobi"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:53
msgid "What are you mapping?"
msgstr "Tayari kwa uchoraji ramani"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:58
msgid ""
"A short description. e.g. Mapping water points and toilets in informal "
"settlements."
msgstr ""
"Maelezo mafupi. mf. Kuchora ramani ya vituo vya maji na vyoo katika "
"makazi yasiyo rasmi."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:67
msgid "Which app will mappers use?"
msgstr "Wachoraji ramani watatumia programu gani?"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:69
msgid "Pick the app you want mappers to install on their phone to do the survey."
msgstr ""
"Chagua programu unayotaka wachoraji ramani wasakinishe kwenye simu zao "
"kufanya dodoso."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:88
#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:120
msgid "Available platforms"
msgstr "Majukwaa yanayopatikana"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:99
msgid ""
"Powerful GIS-style mapping app, including geometry editing, but with a "
"simple\n"
"                mapping pathway enabled via our HOT plugin."
msgstr ""
"Programu madhubuti ya kuchora ramani ya mtindo wa GIS, ikijumuisha "
"kuhariri jiometria, lakini yenye njia rahisi ya kuchora ramani "
"iliyowezeshwa kupitia programu-jalizi yetu ya HOT."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:123
msgid "Android only"
msgstr "Android pekee"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:127
msgid ""
"Simple form-based survey app. Best for straightforward question-and-"
"answer\n"
"                surveys."
msgstr ""
"Programu rahisi ya dodoso inayotegemea fomu. Inafaa zaidi kwa dodoso za "
"moja kwa moja za maswali na majibu."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:136
msgid "Where are you mapping?"
msgstr "Tayari kwa uchoraji ramani"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:138
msgid "Draw the area mappers will cover. Smaller areas are easier to coordinate."
msgstr ""
"Chora eneo ambalo wachoraji ramani watashughulikia. Maeneo madogo ni "
"rahisi kuratibu."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:145
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Hashtags"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:147
msgid "optional"
msgstr "hiari"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:151
msgid ""
"Add tags so other people can find your project. Tags are like #buildings "
"or\n"
"          #campaign-2026."
msgstr ""
"Ongeza lebo ili watu wengine waweze kupata mradi wako. Lebo ni kama "
"#buildings au #campaign-2026."

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:157
msgid "Type a tag and press Enter"
msgstr "Andika hashtags na ubonyeze Enter au koma"

#: app/templates/new_project_custom.html:162
msgid "Press Enter or comma after each tag. Click × on a tag to remove it."
msgstr ""
"Andika hashtags na ubonyeze Enter au koma ili kuziongeza. Bofya × kwenye "
"lebo ili kuiondoa."

